    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this 3 bedroom semi-detached home to the market.\n\nThis beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached home offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or those looking for a comfortable modern home.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming living room, a spacious kitchen/dining area, a separate utility room and a convenient guest WC. The kitchen/dining area provides an excellent space for both everyday family living and entertaining.\n\nUpstairs, there are three good-sized bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite shower room. A main family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\n\nThe property has been freshly painted throughout, creating a bright, clean and neutral finish and allowing the new owners to move in with ease. Overall, this is a well-maintained and generously proportioned home offering excellent accommodation in a practical and appealing layout.\n\nProsperous is a bustling town with a wide selection of both primary and secondary schools and shopping. It is an ideal location for commuters with excellent links to Dublin via the M4 and N7. The nearest train stations are located in in both Sallins and Maynooth. The village of Clane and town of Naas are within a short driving distance away.\n\nViewing is highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Tiled flooring, light fitting, alarm point, radiator\n\nKitchen/Dining: Tiled flooring, light fitting, fully fitted kitchen, area fully plumbed, oven, hob, extractor fan, tiled splash back area, door leading to rear garden, radiator\n\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring, light fitting, worktop, storage, washing machine, tumble dryer, radiator\n\nLiving Room: Carpet flooring, light fitting, feature fireplace with wrought iron insert and polished hearth, radiator\n\nLanding: Carpet flooring, light fitting, attic access, hot press with shelving and storage\n\nFamily Bathroom: Tiled floor to ceiling, light fitting, bath, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket, heated towel rail\n\nMaster Bedroom: Carpet flooring, light fitting, walk in wardrobe, radiator\n\nEnsuite: Tiled floor to ceiling, light fitting, shower, WHB, WC\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, light fitting, fully fitted wardrobe, radiator\n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring, light fitting, radiator\n\nFeatures:\n\nWired for alarm\nSelected carpets, curtains/blinds and light fittings throughout\nSatellite TV\nBroadband/WiFi\nHardwood hall door\nHardwood double glazed windows\nOutside tap\nSecurity lights\nShed\nMains water\nMains sewage\nGas heating\nBuilt 2007\nc.99.4sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding  that all negotiations are conducted  through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
